# Serverpod conventions

- Spine endpoints: `createDeposit`, `assignNight`, `listToday` (+ auth/org helpers).
- Models: Organization, Membership, Room, Deposit, ShiftClose, AuditEvent — all tenant-scoped.
- Use generated client from Flutter; do not hand-roll HTTP for till APIs.
- Migrations required for every model change; `dart test` for tenant isolation.
- Deploy via Serverpod Cloud (`scloud`); document demo URL in SESSION_LOG.
